                <syl /><neume facs="#m-4221cfdf-bb35-4f3d-8c73-12173b8de2c1" type="clivis" xml:id="m-0a77efba-3f40-4f43-8c5c-7b992e3e2fd7">
                  <nc xml:id="m-44562c2c-2aa6-4160-acf6-47dd62ad9010" pname="f" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-be837a52-402a-417a-9a9c-cc99a364a43d" pname="e" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-aaba382d-7512-48f6-83d5-06a58e943464"><syl /><neume facs="#m-a4ae0e50-c4d5-44e5-a387-a5127724d9f0" type="torculus" xml:id="m-80659cb6-204c-4f26-8686-c3d0bf6ac1b7"><nc xml:id="m-b4fc6288-d1cd-4ff0-ad67-526928d4c899" pname="f" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-2d20082b-cb69-40fa-8dae-c976eea13855" pname="g" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-e7fa9a5d-29e7-41f7-8744-537c9378af44" pname="f" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><custos xml:id="m-e30fa99b-b376-4265-9806-6989c3d2e5fc" facs="#m-87c81bf0-5492-40f4-9161-ce6a06d40cee" pname="f" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-2a636964-10a9-4c23-b024-77fa3ebda174"><lg xml:id="m-cb560117-c752-4aa2-b740-ada612c272c6"><l xml:id="m-baec8967-4506-46ca-a5dc-54aa8e951bf9" facs="#m-77772a5d-eb4d-4c17-b823-da70ed95b032" label="ambiguous">(4s)</l><l xml:id="m-5094a4d9-7741-4477-b435-205a74421405" facs="#m-8a075516-4784-4b8b-84e3-4eedf7843bb8" label="text-like">Proper feasts of U. S. A.</l><l xml:id="m-b0ebb760-2d65-4791-8f8a-f3b5eec2bdb7" facs="#m-fbf79580-01d2-462b-8c3d-93ea34b1a390" label="ambiguous">Lectio Epistolae beati Pauli Apostoli ad Thessalonicenses</l><l xml:id="m-c1fe2f6f-3344-4704-a67b-97039d687fd5" facs="#m-50cac303-b492-47f2-9001-5bdb562a9961" label="ambiguous">Thess. 2,2</l><l xml:id="m-37c22544-e008-486c-9e07-f1422b2f47b0" facs="#m-d99e444a-12aa-433d-b045-02f955fb91ff" label="lyrics-like">LRatres: Fidúciam habúimus áliis. Cum possémus vobis óneri</l><l xml:id="m-8b88be50-b467-4a64-9a4c-4e97cbedf087" facs="#m-bcb6f905-6377-4dd1-bb13-92a73535195a" label="lyrics-like">1 in Deo nostro loqui ad vos esse ut Christi Apóstoli: sed</l><l xml:id="m-6f4fe9a3-1ff8-4b53-9658-f4b015f4b03c" facs="#m-c5853d9e-1c6a-4d60-91c3-9e3025db4c87" label="lyrics-like">Evangélium Dei in multa sollici¬</l><l xml:id="m-10271706-3a76-4994-b545-f2a05ef7bb21" facs="#m-49aab91b-bdc0-4ac8-b2bd-6e5411d3c3ea" label="lyrics-like">facti sumus párvuli in médio</l><l xml:id="m-9e223f3c-767d-46fa-832b-9c5d76e0b522" facs="#m-b0c30b3e-1367-4af8-9d7c-5c20a250dd6f" label="ambiguous">vestrum, tamquam si nutrix</l><l xml:id="m-f77b9e42-39ce-41e7-b02b-45798598f07b" facs="#m-e3eba425-c4c4-49a1-80e2-dd950eafe020" label="lyrics-like">túdine. Exhortátio enim nostra</l><l xml:id="m-fabf881e-f739-4f09-bbbe-3c000914bf02" facs="#m-ee2b76f5-a11e-4d49-b36b-ad23a264d32e" label="lyrics-like">fóveat filios suos. Ita deside¬</l><l xml:id="m-5231cb1b-00e0-4262-ae45-66f1f6c84310" facs="#m-dde3ab3d-eed4-477d-9633-78c7a3b3bba9" label="lyrics-like">non de erróre, neque de immun¬</l><l xml:id="m-6f36e961-1620-4c28-a8e8-9dcca32b6279" facs="#m-12717a59-9aaa-409b-bfb9-0dcc013ee5cd" label="lyrics-like">rántes vos, cúpide volebámus</l><l xml:id="m-9e9ad538-c974-4025-8673-ef26f2f14f55" facs="#m-bab7127e-6162-4267-9824-16077e8810a7" label="ambiguous">ditia, neque in dolo, sed sicut</l><l xml:id="m-cb81e8af-e2e7-4192-a110-fa8f175432f9" facs="#m-06e7f398-9506-4760-a454-d6a7e890e787" label="lyrics-like">trádere vobis non solum Evan¬</l><l xml:id="m-11fc4bdf-54ac-4878-952a-b5cb472aad19" facs="#m-a0c3aae9-e07d-4591-9ae5-56ad0d1ff862" label="lyrics-like">probáti sumus a Deo, ut cre¬</l><l xml:id="m-1d9dca2a-0318-4986-84be-c0ce26149f16" facs="#m-708a97e6-3c0c-41e1-90c5-e75bfaabb6f1" label="lyrics-like">derétur nobis Evangélium: ita</l><l xml:id="m-9dd4315d-0834-46a3-a955-0c38d7112352" facs="#m-ceea0dc1-8bd6-4fcd-9a75-6731a6654a25" label="lyrics-like">gélium Dei, sed étiam ánimas</l><l xml:id="m-ff01c2aa-475e-4b94-93b3-4c81004a163c" facs="#m-8d0c2286-79d8-481f-a39c-c2db1fb5cadd" label="lyrics-like">nostras: quóniam carissimi nobis</l><l xml:id="m-aabdfc32-76e7-434e-a5e4-65f510ec3cfd" facs="#m-94f6f01e-3e3f-4c99-a693-e1b5bdc6a705" label="lyrics-like">lóquimur non quasi hominibus</l><l xml:id="m-09ee7ff8-a58b-4b16-9da4-46b2aa5e75d9" facs="#m-abf2cf74-e078-42b2-881c-7fcf87523b0e" label="lyrics-like">placéntes, sed Deo qui probat</l><l xml:id="m-54d24e99-f71d-40ac-9f23-8545d4176410" facs="#m-2f2690e4-0376-4d53-8e62-c2d1fe079ea4" label="lyrics-like">facti estis. Mémores enim estis,</l><l xml:id="m-505ad70b-dc82-4342-97df-8cab5dae4163" facs="#m-ba555f74-04b4-4a31-bdc9-59253fe8760f" label="lyrics-like">fratres, labóris nostri, et fatiga¬</l><l xml:id="m-9bd62df3-a3a9-4384-8818-707a87a8f0b8" facs="#m-9c9815ea-a718-4689-a3b0-a6fc7beefde0" label="ambiguous">corda nostra. Neque enim ali¬</l><l xml:id="m-2f9f6921-1619-4118-bf72-d5bd1ed9fcd3" facs="#m-f611ea25-c410-4020-aff6-158128c9b0d0" label="lyrics-like">quándo fúimus in sermóne adula¬</l><l xml:id="m-f65a53cf-11b8-4914-850a-83efb4d7abe8" facs="#m-cb229adb-ba24-4b3f-8b96-9a048f299ec4" label="lyrics-like">tiónis: nocte ac die operántes, ne</l><l xml:id="m-abdc0e0f-e4be-41a6-a572-f33aebb33764" facs="#m-9b75909e-7238-4af2-9280-aad7033c6964" label="lyrics-like">tiónis, sicut scitis: neque in</l><l xml:id="m-ca7f7e4d-c606-44bc-b5f8-6a6609dad839" facs="#m-5675fb9b-5089-47ed-a762-da46a7153210" label="lyrics-like">quem vestrum gravarémus, prae¬</l><l xml:id="m-6e762867-afd1-4bbd-ba74-f8dda219abf7" facs="#m-2ce222ae-b9e5-4b2b-b93c-cf88b51004d9" label="lyrics-like">dicávimus in vobis Evangélium</l><l xml:id="m-3355c47d-3349-44fe-8beb-74a9448fa445" facs="#m-2d29a01a-909f-4485-a1e5-57f402b85c49" label="lyrics-like">occasióne avaritiae: Deus testis</l><l xml:id="m-a0ca2051-d9f4-4211-8d0b-87676844aa51" facs="#m-e2763392-6976-4d32-af0f-eef8319db19c" label="lyrics-like">est: nec quaeréntes ab homínibus! Dei.</l><l xml:id="m-040c13c7-5ac7-47e9-9a91-1280945b94d0" facs="#m-ce2ca92e-6be7-44b5-82c3-7bdb31c24a04" label="lyrics-like">glóriam, neque a vobis, neque ab</l><l xml:id="m-fa645077-0a30-421e-b0e8-712dc61b8c11" facs="#m-31177e02-58be-4cbd-acc7-07d5928edee0" label="lyrics-like">Gradual. Jústus ut pálma. p. 1201.</l><l xml:id="m-96712623-f660-41b2-9f33-90ed83801a7b" facs="#m-543c2b31-09dc-4274-9235-48371f16f7d3" label="ambiguous">6. E</l><l xml:id="m-d821cbd8-51a2-49e4-8319-21ab5cf2c2e2" facs="#m-aeca2811-6ead-4065-b4bf-2f99bf5c9b75" label="lyrics-like">HL le-lé¬</l><l xml:id="m-bba275b8-eaa3-40a8-bf6b-0f9558ca30c8" facs="#m-bdc89939-bb8d-476d-95ee-facae443bfdf" label="lyrics-like">V. Dó-mi-nus</l><l xml:id="m-a9d71522-8e63-41ef-b476-944da060f055" facs="#m-85c3ca76-7fd6-40b8-a403-a56664eb2a84" label="ambiguous">ia."7.</l><l xml:id="m-c6d0a244-bca3-4b8d-a51d-4462bfc00fc6" facs="#m-fcba5ac3-1a58-4bca-8cdc-0e03a0901eac" label="lyrics-like">dá-bit vérbum evange-li¬</l><l xml:id="m-8a9c4fa8-1560-48be-8ff5-8fbb4cb4c959" facs="#m-d0d7af4f-40b5-4a54-8f55-9c7099e27acc" label="lyrics-like">zán¬</l><l xml:id="m-493652a5-8f3b-46f7-b2f2-483247f04b07" facs="#m-c85506b7-4dc3-414a-a292-63108438fe85" label="ambiguous">ti- bus</l><l xml:id="m-6cd56cae-34b5-49b2-92e8-46c51ecd2c6a" facs="#m-9f0b1e14-5291-4884-b984-66fef9a4c834" label="lyrics-like">virtú-te“ múl¬ ta.</l><l xml:id="m-1ca23bc8-c553-46d5-a4eb-b3f50a1d80a7" facs="#m-7a7f95d7-f18d-4412-949f-bc7394502036" label="ambiguous">Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Matthaeum</l><l xml:id="m-0cc77ceb-97d2-452a-b0d4-905154e92a8f" facs="#m-49fa1cba-857b-4736-9a51-a19ad6e7cd82" label="ambiguous">Matth. 9, 35-38</l><l xml:id="m-4da256e3-943e-4ec6-9e46-004d07e6d527" facs="#m-20b3dfd9-fc42-47c2-973f-4d043c8e094b" label="lyrics-like">(N illo témpore: Circuibat Jesus [quia erant vexáti, et jacéntes</l><l xml:id="m-78882ea8-723d-46db-bb23-802833eac44e" facs="#m-a2248654-eb2f-4cde-9a36-67b79488b24f" label="lyrics-like">l sicut oves non habéntes pastó¬</l><l xml:id="m-bd121fdb-b212-444f-8f57-887f7e150da7" facs="#m-a57b4f73-caae-474e-ac4f-830f54c7e3d4" label="lyrics-like">L omnes civitátes, et castélla,</l><l xml:id="m-343c9a77-6f12-4a97-8fcc-c11a24088f67" facs="#m-a0a1ecbc-72b5-40fe-992e-a2da476bc94a" label="ambiguous">rem. Tunc dicit discipulis suis:</l><l xml:id="m-c8a47dbc-d6d8-40d0-a092-fe64dbaf12b8" facs="#m-c16721dd-8a7a-4c67-a5b7-fbfce5935dbc" label="lyrics-like">docens in synagógis eórum, et</l><l xml:id="m-1f83f76d-b067-4139-beaa-93702c095220" facs="#m-37f09e62-66d4-4fd2-bebd-a821917a0d2d" label="lyrics-like">Messis quidem multa, operárii</l><l xml:id="m-0b0052df-7fd7-4bc3-841e-02793396a2d8" facs="#m-71392dee-e523-467c-bdbd-eb0ab937b858" label="lyrics-like">praédicans Evangélium regni, et</l><l xml:id="m-62cd8c8f-31c5-4441-9d13-aa159d68f39e" facs="#m-1d117259-77b0-48ba-b1c7-bac849483ad0" label="lyrics-like">curans omnem languórem, etl autem pauci. Rogáte ergo Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-57dc11fb-c8e7-4fa5-a5ce-78d65dca24c8" facs="#m-75743856-c903-4ea6-bbff-fb7fc180f584" label="lyrics-like">omnem infirmitátem. Videns au- num messis, ut mittat operários</l><l xml:id="m-0292d1fe-5af9-4814-ad66-092702b0f422" facs="#m-6eeec0e8-bad1-49c7-826d-c71c118041cb" label="lyrics-like">tem turbas, misértus est eis:l in messem suam.</l><l xml:id="m-556bfa32-7812-4d69-80a4-d58196cd47fb" facs="#m-96b73720-de73-4f10-9250-7cdf592c9a48" label="ambiguous">orert.</l><l xml:id="m-03eb6382-5c6c-4869-82fd-0b377ffa0dc2" facs="#m-5f08bae4-0280-445f-9c7d-60ad6fc64656" label="ambiguous">6.</l><l xml:id="m-db094129-7f37-43d2-b5f7-adf3f5b98aa3" facs="#m-70db25f5-5eac-4e8a-9722-156f2ae6b97a" label="ambiguous">B</l><l xml:id="m-f7cb3032-9242-4071-aab2-d75ae6bc5b6c" facs="#m-4ec2c305-eb53-4ca0-8db5-aa18f249d323" label="lyrics-like">Enedí-cti- "per-i-tú-ri super me</l><l xml:id="m-4af2379d-b3c2-4aec-90e0-dedbcfeeb335" facs="#m-8a4f1644-d858-4c9d-a13b-6b740aac3a9f" label="ambiguous">veni¬ e</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
